{"Using reminder.retryCount + 1 risks lost updates when multiple workers/processes operate on the same reminder - should use Prisma's atomic operator instead (retryCount: { increment: 1 })": 0.875821590423584, "Deleting by retryCount > 1 without constraining by method or date may delete more reminders than intended - any WorkflowReminder with retryCount > 1 is now eligible for deletion, even if it's not SMS or its scheduledDate is in the future": 0.9846280813217163, "The retry increment logic is duplicated in both the else branch (no scheduledSMS.sid) and the catch block - extracting this into a shared helper or function will reduce the risk of divergence and make future changes to the retry policy easier": 0.3184172809123993}